    `o 62 r 8(5)(e)(i) an acknowledgment of receipt for a book or document referred to in (a), (b), (c) or (d)`
    `o 62 r 8(5)(e)(ii) an acknowledgment of receipt for any other thing produced under section 20 of the Code`
    `o 62 r 8(5)(e)(iii) an acknowledgment of receipt for any other property seized under section 35 of the Code`
    `o 62 r 8(5)(e)(iv) an acknowledgment of receipt for any other article placed in safe custody under section 78 of the Code`
    `o 62 r 8(5)(f) a written order issued by such an officer under section 20 of the Code`
    `o 62 r 8(5)(g) a written order issued to the defendant or contravening person by such an officer under section 21 of the Code`
    `o 62 r 8(5)(h) a statement made by any person to such an officer under section 22 of the Code`
    `o 62 r 8(5)(i) a statement made by the defendant or contravening person to such an officer under section 23 of the Code`
    `o 62 r 8(5)(j) a search warrant issued in respect of the premises under section 24 of the Code`
